From d34518a9718dd532c75c4fe320c497e17814555f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 01:39:07 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] chain: add a placeholder Lotus V2 genesis for mainnet and
 testnet

Mainnet and testnet still used Bitcoin's 2009 genesis parameters, which
under V2 hashing produce no valid proof of work. Give both networks a
temporary, properly mined genesis so they can start before launch. The
genesis is replaced at launch, resetting both chains; until then
IsPlaceholderGenesis() is true and nodes warn at startup.

Contents:
- nTime 1792368000 (2026-10-19T00:00:00Z), nBits 0x1d00ffff, V2
  header version, 50 coin reward to Satoshi's genesis key.
- The coinbase answers Bitcoin's genesis headline ("19/Oct/2026
  Chancellor on brink of second Lotus") and pushes the genesis block
  hash of the Lotus V1 network of the same type.
- A second transaction spends Bitcoin's genesis coinbase output
  4a5e1e4baab89f3a32518a88c31bc87f618f76673e2cc77ab2127b7afdeda33b:0
  and pays 50 coins back to Satoshi's genesis key ("Returned to
  sender"). Genesis transactions are not validated or added to the coin
  set, so it is symbolic only.

Mined values (valid without CheckProofOfWork's genesis exemption):
  mainnet nonce 7612265698
          hash   000000001d4f799ae04ce551956bfde3a2614f1a436a995a1aeae19522a36388
          merkle 5840374ac4f460eeca1453d2d313f26d8bc937e878e2cca3d59c86c40099a09a
  testnet nonce 166335650
          hash   00000000ecba3e71b2c96d27565993b12661cdf3f7a81ad00df50b7baabccaae
          merkle cd34e0783d193972653c350b58dea8997a9be2241a5f0a795110e64a33ebbf6f

Regtest genesis is unchanged. CreateGenesisBlock now takes the coinbase
scriptSig and optional extra transactions.

lotus_v2_genesis_tests checks the hashes, standalone proof of work,
serialization round trip and the Bitcoin-genesis spend.

(cherry picked from commit aa687323559d63c468d8d9212aec01b1d5f58007)

Canonical-Source-Commit: aa687323559d63c468d8d9212aec01b1d5f58007

